{"step_index":358,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:22:59Z","content":"كده الـ Backend بقى متوافق 100% مع الكود الحقيقي بتاعنا. خليني أضيف function لاختيار الملفات عن طريق native file dialog (اللي الـ Frontend بيحتاجها):","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add select_files method for native file dialog and select_directory method","EndLine":87,"Instruction":"Add file selection methods after run_get_session","ReplacementContent":"    def run_get_session(self) -> dict:\n        return self.server_manager.run_get_session()\n\n    def select_files(self, file_type: str) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Opens a native file dialog. Returns JSON list of selected file paths.\"\"\"\n        import webview\n        if not self.window:\n            return \"[]\"\n        \n        if file_type == 'warehouse':\n            file_types = ('Warehouse Files (*.pdf;*.xlsx;*.xls;*.json)', 'All Files (*.*)')\n        else:\n            file_types = ('Shortage Files (*.pdf;*.xlsx;*.xls)', 'All Files (*.*)')\n        \n        result = self.window.create_file_dialog(\n            webview.OPEN_DIALOG,\n            allow_multiple=True,\n            file_types=file_types\n        )\n        \n        if result:\n            return json.dumps([str(p) for p in result])\n        return \"[]\"\n\n    def select_directory(self) -> str:\n        \"\"\"Opens a native directory picker. Returns selected path.\"\"\"\n        import webview\n        if not self.window:\n            return \"\"\n        result = self.window.create_file_dialog(webview.FOLDER_DIALOG)\n        if result and len(result) > 0:\n            return str(result[0])\n        return \"\"","StartLine":85,"TargetContent":"    def run_get_session(self) -> dict:\n        return self.server_manager.run_get_session()","TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\backend.py","toolAction":"Adding file dialog methods","toolSummary":"Add file dialog"}}]}
