{"step_index":379,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T22:41:55Z","content":"ولا يهمك يا باشا، حقك عليا! أنا فهمت قصدك 100%. إنت مش عايز \"صفحة ويب\" شكلها بدائي، إنت عايز **برنامج احترافي** (Desktop App) زي برامج إدارة الصيدليات اللي بتتباع جاهزة (Sidebar على اليمين، ألوان مريحة للعين، تأثيرات حركية، وأيقونات احترافية).\n\nأنا هعيد برمجة الـ UI (واجهة المستخدم) والتصميم بالكامل من الصفر عشان تطلع بمستوى يليق بالصيدلية.\n\nهبدأ بملف الـ `index.html` (هحوله لنظام Sidebar Layout احترافي) وبعدها هحدث الـ `style.css` بأحدث تصميم.","thinking":"**Reviewing Design Deficiencies**\n\nOkay, I've got the user's feedback, and it's pretty clear: the UI/UX just isn't cutting it. Specifically, it's being called out as lacking in design and looking bad. I'm focusing on those two key problems now.\n\n\n**Reimagining the Interface**\n\nI'm now diving deep into what the user wants: a real app experience, not just a webpage. They're asking for something on par with a modern ordering or pharmacy app. The existing HTML is a bare-bones single-page layout, with no visual polish at all. I have to transform that into something that has a Sidebar, clean cards, modern typography, good shadows, FontAwesome/Heroicons, and a cohesive color scheme like medical green or blue. I'm focusing on these elements to rewrite the UI.\n\n\n**Implementing Visual Improvements**\n\nI'm now focusing on specific design elements. I've chosen a color scheme: Medical Blue, Success Green, and a dark text against a light background. The sidebar will include a logo and navigation links, and I'll add smooth fade-in animations for a better user experience. File drop zones need to resemble dashed boxes with hover effects, while the results screen will feature metric cards with large numbers. I'm going to rewrite the HTML and CSS and I'm ready to begin the rewrite. The Javascript logic might need some minor adjustments after the UI update, focusing primarily on the HTML and CSS first. I'm starting with the HTML structure to make sure it contains a `<div class=\"layout\">`, `<aside class=\"sidebar\">`, and `<main class=\"main-content\">` structure.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Rewrite index.html to have a professional desktop app layout (Sidebar + Main Content) instead of a basic webpage","EndLine":201,"Instruction":"Replace entire file with a professional layout","ReplacementContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Pharmacy Matcher</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <!-- Phosphor Icons for professional UI icons -->\n    <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/@phosphor-icons/web\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../static/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"toast-container\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"app-layout\">\n        <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->\n        <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"brand\">\n                <i class=\"ph-fill ph-first-aid\"></i>\n                <div class=\"brand-text\">\n                    <h1>فارما ماتش</h1>\n                    <span>Pharmacy Matcher</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n                <button class=\"nav-item active\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-new', this)\">\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-plus-circle\"></i> عملية مطابقة جديدة\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-item\" onclick=\"loadHistory(); showScreen('screen-history', this)\">\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-clock-counter-clockwise\"></i> سجل العمليات\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"nav-item\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-settings', this)\">\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-gear\"></i> إعدادات النظام\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div class=\"sidebar-footer\">\n                <div class=\"server-status-card\">\n                    <div class=\"status-header\">\n                        <div id=\"server-indicator\" class=\"status-indicator\"></div>\n                        <span id=\"server-status-text\">جاري التحقق...</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button id=\"btn-toggle-server\" class=\"btn btn-small btn-full\">تشغيل السيرفر</button>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"nav-item text-danger mt-2\" onclick=\"exitApp()\">\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-sign-out\"></i> إغلاق البرنامج\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"main-content\">\n            \n            <!-- Screen 1: New Process (Default) -->\n            <div id=\"screen-new\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <header class=\"page-header\">\n                    <h2><i class=\"ph-fill ph-magic-wand\"></i> مطابقة نواقص ومخازن جديدة</h2>\n                    <p>قم بإدراج ملفات النواقص وملفات المخازن للبدء في المطابقة الذكية.</p>\n                </header>\n                \n                <div class=\"upload-grid\">\n                    <!-- Shortages -->\n                    <div class=\"upload-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header primary\">\n                            <i class=\"ph-fill ph-clipboard-text\"></i>\n                            <h3>1. ملفات النواقص</h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"drop-zone\" id=\"zone-shortage\">\n                            <i class=\"ph ph-upload-simple drop-icon\"></i>\n                            <h4>اضغط لاختيار الملفات</h4>\n                            <p>(يدعم PDF / Excel)</p>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"selectFiles('shortage')\">تصفح الملفات</button>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul id=\"list-shortage\" class=\"file-list\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Warehouses -->\n                    <div class=\"upload-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header secondary\">\n                            <i class=\"ph-fill ph-buildings\"></i>\n                            <h3>2. قوائم المخازن</h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"drop-zone\" id=\"zone-warehouse\">\n                            <i class=\"ph ph-upload-simple drop-icon\"></i>\n                            <h4>اضغط لاختيار الملفات</h4>\n                            <p>(يدعم PDF / Excel / JSON)</p>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"selectFiles('warehouse')\">تصفح الملفات</button>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul id=\"list-warehouse\" class=\"file-list\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"action-bar-bottom\">\n                    <button id=\"btn-submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-massive\" onclick=\"submitProcess()\" disabled>\n                        <i class=\"ph-fill ph-play-circle\"></i> بدء عملية المطابقة\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div id=\"progress-area\" class=\"progress-overlay hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"progress-box\">\n                        <div class=\"spinner\"></div>\n                        <h3 id=\"progress-text\">جاري معالجة الملفات...</h3>\n                        <p>يرجى الانتظار، قد تستغرق العملية بعض الوقت حسب حجم الملفات.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Screen 2: Results -->\n            <div id=\"screen-results\" class=\"screen\">\n                <header class=\"page-header\">\n                    <h2><i class=\"ph-fill ph-check-circle\"></i> تقرير نتائج المطابقة</h2>\n                    <p>تم الانتهاء من فحص الملفات وإنشاء تقرير الإكسيل بنجاح.</p>\n                </header>\n                \n                <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-icon\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-list-numbers\"></i></div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-info\">\n                            <span class=\"stat-title\">إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة</span>\n                            <strong id=\"stat-total\" class=\"stat-value\">0</strong>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-card stat-success\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-icon\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-check-fat\"></i></div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-info\">\n                            <span class=\"stat-title\">تمت المطابقة بنجاح</span>\n                            <div class=\"stat-flex\">\n                                <strong id=\"stat-matched\" class=\"stat-value\">0</strong>\n                                <span id=\"stat-matched-pct\" class=\"stat-badge\">0%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-card stat-warning\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-icon\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-warning\"></i></div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-info\">\n                            <span class=\"stat-title\">يحتاج مراجعة (غير مؤكد)</span>\n                            <div class=\"stat-flex\">\n                                <strong id=\"stat-review\" class=\"stat-value\">0</strong>\n                                <span id=\"stat-review-pct\" class=\"stat-badge\">0%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-card stat-danger\">\n                        <div class=\"stat-icon\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-x-circle\"></i></div>\n                        <div class=\"stat-info\">\n                            <span class=\"stat-title\">غير متوفر في المخازن</span>\n                            <div class=\"stat-flex\">\n                                <strong id=\"stat-notfound\" class=\"stat-value\">0</strong>\n                                <span id=\"stat-notfound-pct\" class=\"stat-badge\">0%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"results-workflow\">\n                    <h3>خطوات المراجعة النهائية:</h3>\n                    <div class=\"workflow-steps\">\n                        <div class=\"step-box\">\n                            <div class=\"step-num\">1</div>\n                            <h4>افتح ملف الإكسيل</h4>\n                            <p>اضغط على الزر لفتح الملف، ثم اذهب لشيت \"يحتاج مراجعة\".</p>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"openExcel()\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-microsoft-excel-logo\"></i> فتح الإكسيل</button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"step-box\">\n                            <div class=\"step-num\">2</div>\n                            <h4>راجع واتخذ القرار</h4>\n                            <p>اختر (✅ مطابق) أو (❌ غير مطابق) لكل صنف، ثم احفظ الملف وأغلقه.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"step-box\">\n                            <div class=\"step-num\">3</div>\n                            <h4>طبق التعديلات</h4>\n                            <p>اضغط هنا لنقل الأصناف لشيتات المخازن وتنظيف القائمة.</p>\n                            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"applyReviews()\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-magic-wand\"></i> تنفيذ التعديلات</button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"folder-action\">\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-text\" onclick=\"openFolder()\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-folder-open\"></i> فتح مجلد حفظ النتائج (Folder)</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Screen 3: History -->\n            <div id=\"screen-history\" class=\"screen\">\n                <header class=\"page-header\">\n                    <h2><i class=\"ph-fill ph-clock-counter-clockwise\"></i> سجل العمليات السابقة</h2>\n                    <p>هنا تجد جميع عمليات المطابقة التي قمت بها سابقاً، يمكنك العودة إليها في أي وقت.</p>\n                </header>\n                \n                <div id=\"history-list\" class=\"history-grid\">\n                    <!-- History items will be injected here -->\n                    <div class=\"empty-state\">\n                        <i class=\"ph-fill ph-empty\"></i>\n                        <p>لا توجد عمليات سابقة مسجلة.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Screen 4: Settings -->\n            <div id=\"screen-settings\" class=\"screen\">\n                <header class=\"page-header\">\n                    <h2><i class=\"ph-fill ph-gear\"></i> إعدادات النظام</h2>\n                    <p>تهيئة الاتصال بالذكاء الاصطناعي وإعدادات السيرفر المحلي.</p>\n                </header>\n                \n                <div class=\"settings-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"settings-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header dark\">\n                            <i class=\"ph-fill ph-plugs\"></i>\n                            <h3>إعدادات الربط والـ APIs</h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card-body form-grid\">\n                            <div class=\"form-group full-width\">\n                                <label>Unstructured.io API Key (لقراءة الـ PDF)</label>\n                                <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-unstructured-key\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"أدخل مفتاح Unstructured\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <label>رابط الخادم المحلي (MSEMAX URL)</label>\n                                <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-local-url\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions\" dir=\"ltr\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <label>مفتاح الخادم المحلي (Local Key)</label>\n                                <input type=\"password\" id=\"setting-local-key\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"أدخل المفتاح\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <label>اسم الموديل (Model Name)</label>\n                                <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-model-name\" class=\"form-control\" value=\"gpt-4o-mini\" dir=\"ltr\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group full-width mt-3\">\n                                <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"saveSettings()\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-floppy-disk\"></i> حفظ الإعدادات</button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"settings-card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header warning\">\n                            <i class=\"ph-fill ph-hard-drives\"></i>\n                            <h3>إدارة سيرفر الذكاء الاصطناعي (MSEMAX)</h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <p class=\"text-muted mb-4\">هذه الإعدادات تستخدم لتشغيل وإعداد سيرفر MSEMAX المحلي على هذا الجهاز.</p>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"form-group mb-4\">\n                                <label>مسار مجلد MSEMAX</label>\n                                <div class=\"input-group\">\n                                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"setting-msemax-dir\" class=\"form-control\" readonly dir=\"ltr\">\n                                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"selectMsemaxDir()\"><i class=\"ph-fill ph-folder-notch-open\"></i> تصفح...</button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"btn-group-vertical\">\n                                <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" onclick=\"setupRequirements()\">\n                                    <i class=\"ph-fill ph-download-simple\"></i>\n                                    <span>تثبيت المتطلبات الأساسية (Requirements + Playwright)</span>\n                                    <span id=\"req-status\" class=\"status-icon\"></span>\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" onclick=\"getSession()\">\n                                    <i class=\"ph-fill ph-key\"></i>\n                                    <span>تجديد جلسة المتصفح (Get Session)</span>\n                                    <span id=\"session-status\" class=\"status-icon\"></span>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- The original screen-home is removed. We use screen-new as the home page. \n         To keep app.js happy if it references screen-home, we add a dummy hidden div -->\n    <div id=\"screen-home\" style=\"display:none;\"></div>\n\n    <script src=\"../static/app.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        // Override showScreen to handle active states on sidebar\n        const originalShowScreen = window.showScreen;\n        window.showScreen = function(screenId, element = null) {\n            // Call original if it exists\n            if (typeof originalShowScreen === 'function') {\n                originalShowScreen(screenId);\n            } else {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));\n                const target = document.getElementById(screenId);\n                if (target) target.classList.add('active');\n            }\n            \n            // Update sidebar active class\n            if (element) {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));\n                element.classList.add('active');\n            }\n        };\n        // Auto select first nav item\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const firstNav = document.querySelector('.nav-item');\n            if (firstNav) firstNav.classList.add('active');\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Pharmacy Matcher</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"../static/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"toast-container\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"app-container\">\n        <!-- Screen 1: Home -->\n        <div id=\"screen-home\" class=\"screen active\">\n            <header class=\"home-header\">\n                <div class=\"server-status-container\">\n                    <div id=\"server-indicator\" class=\"status-indicator\"></div>\n                    <span id=\"server-status-text\">جاري التحقق من السيرفر...</span>\n                    <button id=\"btn-toggle-server\" class=\"btn btn-small btn-outline\">تشغيل السيرفر</button>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n            \n            <div class=\"hero\">\n                <h1 class=\"app-title\">Pharmacy Matcher</h1>\n                <h2 class=\"app-subtitle\">نظام مطابقة الأدوية</h2>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid-menu\">\n                <button class=\"menu-card\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-new')\">\n                    <div class=\"menu-icon\">🆕</div>\n                    <h3>عملية جديدة</h3>\n                    <p>بدء مطابقة نواقص ومخازن جديدة</p>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"menu-card\" onclick=\"loadHistory(); showScreen('screen-history')\">\n                    <div class=\"menu-icon\">📜</div>\n                    <h3>السجل</h3>\n                    <p>عرض العمليات السابقة والنتائج</p>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"menu-card\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-settings')\">\n                    <div class=\"menu-icon\">⚙️</div>\n                    <h3>الإعدادات</h3>\n                    <p>إعدادات النظام والـ API</p>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"menu-card menu-card-danger\" onclick=\"exitApp()\">\n                    <div class=\"menu-icon\">❌</div>\n                    <h3>خروج</h3>\n                    <p>إغلاق التطبيق</p>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Screen 2: New Process -->\n        <div id=\"screen-new\" class=\"screen\">\n            <header class=\"screen-header\">\n                <button class=\"btn-back\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-home')\">🔙 رجوع</button>\n                <h2>عملية مطابقة جديدة</h2>\n            </header>\n            \n            <div class=\"upload-container\">\n                <div class=\"drop-zone\" id=\"zone-warehouse\">\n                    <h3>ملفات المخازن</h3>\n                    <p class=\"zone-desc\">(PDF / Excel / JSON)</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"selectFiles('warehouse')\">اختيار ملفات</button>\n                    <ul id=\"list-warehouse\" class=\"file-list\"></ul>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"drop-zone\" id=\"zone-shortage\">\n                    <h3>ملفات النواقص</h3>\n                    <p class=\"zone-desc\">(PDF / Excel)</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"selectFiles('shortage')\">اختيار ملفات</button>\n                    <ul id=\"list-shortage\" class=\"file-list\"></ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"action-bar\">\n                <button id=\"btn-submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large\" onclick=\"submitProcess()\" disabled>▶️ بدء المطابقة</button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div id=\"progress-area\" class=\"hidden\">\n                <div class=\"spinner\"></div>\n                <p id=\"progress-text\">جاري معالجة الملفات...</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Screen 3: Results -->\n        <div id=\"screen-results\" class=\"screen\">\n            <header class=\"screen-header\">\n                <button class=\"btn-back\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-home')\">🔙 الرئيسية</button>\n                <h2>نتائج المطابقة</h2>\n            </header>\n            \n            <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-title\">إجمالي النواقص</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-total\" class=\"stat-value\">0</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card stat-success\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-title\">تمت المطابقة</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-matched\" class=\"stat-value\">0</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-matched-pct\" class=\"stat-pct\">0%</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card stat-danger\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-title\">غير متوفر</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-notfound\" class=\"stat-value\">0</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-notfound-pct\" class=\"stat-pct\">0%</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card stat-warning\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-title\">يحتاج مراجعة</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-review\" class=\"stat-value\">0</div>\n                    <div id=\"stat-review-pct\" class=\"stat-pct\">0%</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"results-actions\">\n                <div class=\"info-box\">\n                    <strong>طريقة العمل:</strong>\n                    افتح ملف الإكسيل، راجع شيت المراجعة، اختر ✅ أو ❌، احفظ، ثم اضغط تنفيذ التعديلات.\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"action-buttons\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"openExcel()\">📊 فتح ملف الإكسيل</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"openFolder()\">📁 فتح مكان الملف</button>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"applyReviews()\">✏️ تنفيذ تعديلات المراجعة</button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Screen 4: History -->\n        <div id=\"screen-history\" class=\"screen\">\n            <header class=\"screen-header\">\n                <button class=\"btn-back\" onclick=\"showScreen('screen-home')\">🔙 رجوع</button>\n                <h2>سجل العمليات</h2>\n            </header>\n            \n            <div id=\"history-list\" class=\"history-container\">\n                <!-- History items will be injected here -->\n                <div class=\"empty-state\">لا توجد عمليات سابقة.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Screen 5: Settings -->\n        <div id=\"screen-settings\" class=\"screen\">\n            <header class=\"sc